# Project workflow

This app is evolving from a random-items demo into a personal task manager in small, reviewable stages (see README Evolution).

## Delivery pattern

- One stage per branch → PR → merge to `master` → delete the branch.
- Next planned stages: 9 priority/due dates, 10 dashboard UI, 11 notes/`updated_at`.
- Do not combine multiple roadmap stages in one PR unless the user explicitly asks.

## Keep until a dedicated stage says otherwise

- Python package path: `src/random_items/` (imports stay `random_items.*`)
- CLI entry: `uv run random-items`
- Default SQLite file: `items.db` (table is already `tasks`)
- GitHub repo slug may stay `random-items`

## Schema and product

- Schema changes go through Alembic (`uv run alembic upgrade head`). Do not bring back startup `create_all` for the real DB.
- Domain language is **Task** / `title` / `/tasks` (not Item / `content` / `/items`).
- No auth, teams, or multi-user features unless the user asks.
- Prefer matching existing patterns over new frameworks or large refactors.
